Z||000004||Cliff Pennock||07-21-2001||07:36 AM||||Spurdon,<P>I'm very sorry but I'll have to deny your site access to my server. I just checked my logs and I <u>really</u> do not appreciate the fact that your site is downloading <B>every single message</B> periodically. That's an incredible waste of bandwidth. But the thing that concerns me the most is that your site is harvesting email-addresses from this forum. And that's an absolute no-no.<P>So please remove this forum (all related messages and email adresses) from your database.<BR>||||reg||4
